a. The public member or city employee or the member's or employee's
immediate family member or domestic partner;

b. Any organization in which the public member, city employee or an
immediate family member or domestic partner of the member or employee
is a director, trustee or officer or has more than five percent (5%) equity or
investment interest or the right to acquire any equity or investment interest
of more than five percent (5%); or

c. Any organization in which the public member, city employee or an
immediate family member or domestic partner of the member or employee
has a compensation arrangement.

2. "City employee" means an appointed, classified or unclassified full-time or part-
time employee of the City of Cheyenne who receives a salary or wage as
remuneration for their time, service and efforts;

3. "Domestic partner" means a person with whom a public official, public member or
city employee maintains a household and an intimate relationship, other than to
whom the public official, public member or employee is legally married.

4. "Immediate family member" means a person's parent, brother, sister, spouse, child,
or the child or spouse of an immediate family member;

5. "Official capacity" means an action of a public official, public member or city
employee, either exercisable alone or with others, to approve, disapprove, shape or
otherwise direct the action of the city council, the action of a city board or
commission or the action of a department of the City of Cheyenne;

6. "Personal or private interest" means an interest which is direct and immediate as
opposed to speculative and remote and is an interest that provides the public official
a greater benefit or a lesser detriment than it does for a large or substantial group or
class of persons who are similarly situated. In determining whether a public official
has a personal or private interest in a matter, the public official shall recognize the
importance of his or her right to represent their constituency;

7. "Private benefit" means the receipt by a public official, public member or city
employee of a gift which resulted from him or her holding an office or position with
the City of Cheyenne. For the purposes of this paragraph, "gift" shall not include
any loan, gift, gratuity, special discount or hospitality with a value of two hundred
fifty dollars ($250.00) or less;

8. "Public official" or "public member" means any elected or appointed Cheyenne
City Council person and any appointed board or commission member serving on a
board or commission of the City of Cheyenne.
